  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">220KV TRANSMISSION DEVELOPMENT IN THE NEW AL-HIDD POWER PLANT</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THE PROJ AIMS AT CONSTRUCTING THE INFRASTRUCTURE NEEDED TO TRANSMIT THE POWER GENERATED IN THE NEW AL_HIDD POWER PLANT TO THE LOAD CENTERS IN AL_MANAMA TO MEET THE INCREASING DEMAND. THIS INCLUDES INSTALLING OF 220 KV BULK SUPPLY SUBSTATION  SIX LINES FOR 6 KM OF 220 KV OIL_FILLED CABLES (UNDERGROUND AND SUBMARINE) TO CONNECT THE PLANT IN AL_MUHA_ RRAQ ISLAND WITH THE EXISTING  NETWORK IN ALMANAMA ISLAND</narrative>
  </description>
